{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Welcome to the Critter Cart Demo!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Ever wondered how your grocery store deliveries are collected and packed? We have an answer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Critter Cart</strong> comes from the desire to race shopping carts around grocery stores. This Demo features the first map and fully unlocked customization of all carts, critters and more. (That we've made so far)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Drift and boost around as you are given procedural checkpoints and must make your own path to complete the race as fast as possible, collecting checkpoints with the highest score possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772070/extras/Gif03-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__3_.gif?t=1748534761\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Customisation</strong>, choose various creatures to race around as. Hats, steering wheels, cart panels are all unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Procedural generation</strong>, the map is a set layout, but placement of checkpoints, hazards, and pick ups are different to ensuring as much replayability as possible.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The most important feature, <strong>Multiplayer</strong>, race around with up to 7 other critters as you compete to see who can get the best time, or the highest score.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772070/extras/Gif02-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter__1_.gif?t=1748534761\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Demo out now. Release date set for Late June.</strong></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.